---
import SectionTitle from "@/components/SectionTitle.astro";
---

<SectionTitle title="About me" />

<div class="dark:text-neutral-400">
  <p class="text-pretty mb-6">
    I'm a frontend developer based in Murcia, Spain. I work across the JavaScript ecosystem — Vue, Angular and Nuxt on the web, Ionic for mobile — and I'm drawn to projects where building the interface well actually matters.
  </p>

  <p class="text-pretty mb-6">
    I came into web development from a different field, through a vocational qualification and a lot of self-teaching. That shaped how I approach the work — I treat learning as something you actively seek out, not something that happens to you.
  </p>

  <p class="text-pretty mb-6">
    I'm meticulous about what I put my name on: clear repository structure, proper documentation, consistent coding practices. I also enjoy building small tools and automations that make daily work more efficient — not because it's required, but because that's how I think about software.
  </p>

  <p class="text-pretty">
    More recently, most of what I build goes through coding agents. I work with Claude, Codex and OpenCode applying Spec-Driven Development, designing workflows where agents are active participants rather than autocomplete. What I find most interesting is the work that comes first: getting the specification right and deciding which parts you always review yourself.
  </p>

  <p class="text-pretty">
    I'm looking to keep moving towards full stack — so far Node and TypeScript on the backend, and PHP, Laravel and SQL before that.
  </p>
</div>
